SCENE
ID=SYNCED_TEST_001
NAME=Synced Runtime Test
DESC=Indicator and number plate ownership test
CATEGORY=NORMAL
CAPABILITIES=SYNCED_COMPATIBLE
COLORS
amber=255,80,0
white=255,255,255
SCRIPT
MOVE BOTH POS 35 SPEED 70
WAIT TARGET
SET BOTH MAINLEDS COLOR amber
SET BOTH LENS COLOR white
SET BOTH NO_PLATELEDS COLOR white
SHOW
WAIT 800ms
CLEAR BOTH MAINLEDS
CLEAR BOTH LENS
CLEAR BOTH NO_PLATELEDS
SHOW
MOVE BOTH POS 0 SPEED 70
WAIT TARGET
END
